        "answer": "Common Hud constructs ThrustMeterContainer directly. It owns a ThrustMeter child. Hidden if HUD or weapon HUD is absent, or any listed hardcore/game-ended/moviecam/demo-hidden/killcam/flash/UI-active/vehicle/guided-missile/location-select/scoreboard/remote-streak/EMP bit is present. FullEnergy tests playerAbilities.playerEnergyRatio against1 through string-coercing model helper. Corresponding visibility/energy model subscriptions reevaluate self. CallOriginalSecond close registers self.__onClose; clips/close outside frozen span are exact dependencies. No movement or energy spending occurs. Optional postload then self return; effective HMH thrust/visibility data remains unknown.",
